<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram name="System Design" id="system-design">
        <mxGraphModel dx="775" dy="218" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="950" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="2" value="Design a Distributed Leaderboard" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="600" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="3" value="Functional Requirements" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="90" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="4" value="1. Score updates via game-completion events (write path)&#xa;2. Get a player&#39;s own rank (per leaderboard)&#xa;3. Get global Top-N (all-time, daily, weekly)&#xa;4. Get local leaderboard - K neighbors above/below a player&#xa;5. Out of scope: per-player score-change history" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="125" width="560" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="5" value="Non-Functional Requirements" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="270" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="6" value="- Availability: 99.9% (~8.7 hrs/yr downtime)&#xa;- Latency: p99 &lt; 200ms (reads)&#xa;- Consistency: own-rank fresh (read-after-write); global rankings eventual (~1 min)&#xa;- Scale: ~1.2k writes/s; ~580 reads/s avg, ~5k reads/s peak (bursty post-event); read-heavy" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="305" width="560" height="95" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7" value="Core Entities" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="440" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="8" value="- Player&#xa;- Leaderboard&#xa;- PlayerScore (one row per player per day; score accumulated through the day;&#xa;  idempotency key = gameId + playerId)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="475" width="560" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="9" value="API Design" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="600" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="10" value="- GET /playerScores/:playerId?timeWindow={all-time|day|week}  -&gt; player&#39;s total score (rank TBD)&#xa;- GET global Top-N leaderboard (all-time|daily|weekly)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="635" width="560" height="70" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="20" value="Architecture" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="750" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r1" value="READ PATH" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="790" width="120" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_client" value="Client" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_gw" value="API Gateway&#xa;(auth)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="280" y="820" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_svc" value="Leaderboard&#xa;Service" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="520" y="820" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_db" value="SQL DB&#xa;PlayerScore&#xa;(idx: playerId+createdAt)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="760" y="810" width="140" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;" parent="1" source="c_client" target="c_gw" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;" parent="1" source="c_gw" target="c_svc" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e3" value="query (durable)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;" parent="1" source="c_svc" target="c_db" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_redis" value="Redis Sorted Sets&#xa;daily | weekly (cal.) | all-time&#xa;ZADD / ZREVRANK / ZREVRANGE&#xa;(primary + replicas, AOF/RDB)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="740" y="980" width="180" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e7" value="read ranks (primary)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="c_svc" target="c_redis" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="w1" value="WRITE PATH" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1120" width="120" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_game" value="Game Completion&#xa;(Client)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1150" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_kafka" value="Kafka&#xa;(partition by playerId)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="280" y="1150" width="140" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c_consumer" value="Consumer&#xa;(idempotent update)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="520" y="1150" width="120" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e4" value="game score event" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;" parent="1" source="c_game" target="c_kafka" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;" parent="1" source="c_kafka" target="c_consumer" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e6" value="update PlayerScore&#xa;(idempotent, cumulative)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;" parent="1" source="c_consumer" target="c_db" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e8" value="ZADD absolute total" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="c_consumer" target="c_redis" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e9" value="rebuild on total loss (rare, batch)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="c_db" target="c_redis" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="dd_hdr" value="Deep Dives" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="1250" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="dd_body" value="1. Precompute ranks in Redis ZSETs to avoid O(N) scan + sort per read.&#xa;&#160;&#160;&#160;ZADD update O(log n) | ZREVRANK rank O(log n) | ZREVRANGE 0..N Top-N | ZREVRANGE r-k..r+k neighbors.&#xa;2. Weekly without per-read union: trade read cost for write cost - each event updates daily + weekly + all-time keys.&#xa;&#160;&#160;&#160;Calendar-week keys reset cleanly at week boundary (weekly rank resets weekly). Justified by ~1 min staleness NFR.&#xa;3. Idempotency under at-least-once delivery: SQL holds authoritative cumulative total (key = gameId+playerId);&#xa;&#160;&#160;&#160;Redis uses absolute ZADD of that total (NOT delta ZINCRBY) -> replay-safe, no double counting.&#xa;4. Memory: all-time ZSET ~10M x ~100B ~= 1 GB -> fits one node; single primary handles 5k reads/s;&#xa;&#160;&#160;&#160;replicas add read-scaling headroom + failover.&#xa;5. Durability/HA: AOF/RDB persistence + circuit breaker on Redis; total loss -> rebuild ZSETs from SQL (rare, batch)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="1285" width="900" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>
